cipant will have a time.  Don't worry about events with a stage start.  You'll want to provide a driver that will allow you to enter a series of participants and their marks for a single event.  Your driver may need to specify whether the event is a field or track event (so you know what derived class you'll be using).  As the data's entered, each EventParticipant is entered onto an array (assume no more than 100 participants).  Assume the participants are in no particular order.  Your driver will also need to give you the ability to sort the results by either name or mark (time or distance).  Score the event so 1st place gets 3 points, 2nd place gets 2 points and 3rd place gets 1 point.","topics":[],"score":223313,"global_rank":165212}]